### routiva CRUD app — sample requests
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP client.
### Start the app first: npm run crud

@host = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### List (paginated, filtered, sorted)
GET {{host}}/api/products?page=1&limit=5&sort=price&order=desc

### List in-stock only, search
GET {{host}}/api/products?inStock=true&search=key

### Stats
GET {{host}}/api/stats

### Categories
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Create
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Webcam HD",
  "sku": "CAM-1",
  "price": 59.99,
  "stock": 7,
  "category": "video"
}

### Read one  (replace :id)
GET {{host}}/api/products/1

### Replace
PUT {{host}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard v2",
  "sku": "KB-100",
  "price": 99.0,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "peripherals"
}

### Partial update
PATCH {{host}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stock": 42 }

### Restock
POST {{host}}/api/products/1/restock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 25 }

### Validation error (422)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "sku": "bad sku", "price": -5 }

### Wrong method (405 + Allow header)
POST {{host}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/1
